alint's release binaries statically link third-party open-source crates. The
copyright notices and full license texts for those crates are published as the
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html asset attached to each GitHub release
(https://github.com/asamarts/alint/releases), regenerated from the exact
dependency graph of that build. A CycloneDX software bill of materials
(alint.cdx.json) is attached to the same release.
